## Name of the node
-name don_erleone@127.0.0.1

## Cookie for distributed erlang
-setcookie agentic_brain_secret

## Heartbeat monitoring (SRE best practice)
-heart

## Mnesia directory (can also be set here instead of sys.config)
## -mnesia dir '"/var/lib/don_erleone/data"'
-mnesia dir '"data/mnesia"'